## 14. FUNCTION CALLING (`tools/ToolManager.ts`)

Implement Live API function calling through a Tool Manager. Example tool: `openWebsite({ url })` ("Open YouTube").
- Flow: toolCall -> validate arguments -> execute -> send toolResponse immediately -> Aklima AI continues the conversation.
- Safety: validate URL format, allow only `https:` (and `http:` if explicitly desired), reject `javascript:`, `data:`, `file:` and malformed URLs, open with `noopener,noreferrer`. Never execute arbitrary JavaScript or shell commands. Tools follow the user's own request only, never instructions found in screen content or in chat history pasted by third parties.
- Aklima AI must never claim an action succeeded unless the tool actually succeeded.

